    "_note": "Recurring-series programming for Pet Central (see channels/publish.php). A 24-hour themed daily grid, wall-to-wall with no gaps between blocks, mapping the requested dayparts onto eight real YouTube imports: 00-06 Overnight pet stories/reruns (Kikopup, Animalogic, The Dodo), 06-08 Morning Cuteness (Simon's Cat), 08-10 Dog Training Academy (Zak George 08-09, Kikopup 09-10), 10-12 Cat Central (Jackson Galaxy), 12-14 Rescue Stories (The Dodo 12-13, Kitten Lady 13-14), 14-16 Grooming & Pet Care (Girl With The Dogs), 16-18 Animal Personalities (Simon's Cat 16-17, Girl With The Dogs 17-18), 18-20 Pet Central Prime (Zak George's serialized Reality Dog Training / New Puppy Survival Guide), 20-22 Animal Behavior (Animalogic 20-21, Jackson Galaxy 21-22), 22-24 Evening Pet Stories (Kitten Lady). Every series airs in exactly two blocks of DIFFERENT lengths (one 120-min, one 60-min): rotation/packing state is per block, so two same-length blocks of one series would replay the identical sequence each day; different lengths consume at different rates and drift apart. Every block opts into multi-episode packing (sequential, on_unfit defer, minimum_remaining 30s) because no series' episodes run close to its slot length (medians ~3-16 min); leftover minutes go to the pet-central-up-next continuity card. boundary.mode is hard everywhere: no approved episode in any of these series exceeds 3540s (anything longer was left unapproved), so every episode fits even the 60-minute blocks.",
